===Etymology===
{{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|brembel}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|bræmbel}}, from earlier {{m|ang|brǣmel}}, {{m|ang|brēmel}}, from dialectal {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{m|gem-pro|*brēmila-}} (compare West Frisian {{m|fy|brommel}}, Flemish {{m|vls|bramel}}, Low German {{m|nds|Brommelbeer}}), diminutive of {{m|gem-pro|*brēm-}} (compare English {{m|en|broom}}). More at {{l|en|broom}}.

